window.products.push({"id":865085,"name":"UD Toothpaste Dispenser Automatic Toothpaste Squeezer Dispenser for Kids & Family Shower, is Wall Mount Bathroom Accessories with Super Sticky Suction","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XLtYlekRL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"【Toothpaste Dispenser More Instruction】: 1.Before installing the toothbrush holder, make sure the wall is dry.2.When using the toothpaste squeezer for the first time or changing to a new toothpaste, you must press it several times to exhaust the air in the toothpaste tube to get the toothpaste.3.The interface diameter of the toothpaste dispenser is 0.47inch (12mm). It is made of resin glue and has a certain tolerance. Although it can fit most toothpastes, it is not that it is suitable for all toothpastes. Not ALL！！! 4.Do not try this dispenser with Sensodyne toothpaste as the tube is different that say, Crest or Colgate.Please confirm the size of your toothpaste, so as not to be unusable and cause your loss.5.Make sure that the sticker is fixed on the wall for several hours, and then installation the toothbrush holder to avoid falling off when the sticker is not completely fixed. Please be sure to fix the sticker on the wall for 4 hours before installing! !6.If your child is under 6 years old, Please accompany your child to use this product. This will not let the child mess up the toothpaste.7.It is suitable for sticking on smooth walls such as tiles, wood boards, mirrors, etc. Please do not install it on rough and uneven walls. Please make sure that the wall is dry and tidy before installation. Water stains and dust will affect the effect of the sticker. 【Installation tips】: 1.Clean and dry the wall, Rip off the protective film of the adhesive.2.Stick to the wall and vent the air, Install toothpaste into the Toothpaste Dispenser.3.Place toothpaste, Squeeze toothpaste by manual to vent air.4.Please use it after 24 hours of installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XLtYlekRL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U/D","source_asin":"B08YXHZQK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-865085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YXHZQK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YXHZQK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
