window.products.push({"id":865247,"name":"Monster Margarita Glass, XXL 34 to 38 Oz. Blue Rim, Mexico","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6187vOryMqL._AC_SL1120_.jpg","description":"Mexican margarita glass XXL with blue rim. Every day is a fiesta whether serving margaritas or even ice cream (a great double dessert or candy dish). Candy is not included. These glasses are crafted in Mexico from lead-free recycled glass. Decorated with the traditional Mexican BLUE rim color they coordinate beautifully with any of the blue rim Mexican glasses. Because they are handmade dimensions may vary slightly. Sturdy enough for everyday use. Mouth-blown lead-free glass. Dishwasher Safe Size: approximately 8 inches High and 6 inches wide and holds around 34 to 38 oz filled to the rim. These Mexican margarita glasses can vary in size due to the nature of being handmade. Care instructions: Our Mexican Glassware is individually mouth blown, hand formed and made from recycled glass. Trapped bubbles and slight variations in form, capacity and color are natural and charming features of the glassware. Although it is quite durable, this glass is not tempered so some extra care is necessary. A cooling-off period is essential after the glassware is removed from the dishwasher. Extreme temperature changes may cause thermal shock and cracking. This glassware is not suitable for serving hot beverages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6187vOryMqL._AC_SL1120_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mexican Margarita Glasses","source_asin":"B077NV3CWK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-865247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077NV3CWK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077NV3CWK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
