window.products.push({"id":865492,"name":"Rubbermaid Craftainers 3E46 Large Portable Organizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PF6SSWAKL._AC_.jpg","description":"For the avid crafter on the go, transporting essential tools and in-progress projects in a standard backpack or tote bag often creates more hassles than convenience. Skeins of yarn tangle, photographs crease, paper crumples, and scissors open their blades to unsuspecting hands when let loose inside such a common bag. Rubbermaid addresses such storage needs for the ever-growing craft populace with their large portable organizer. From Rubbermaid's Craftainers line, the organizer offers a variety of pockets and slots, custom-designed for knitters or the scrapbook-inclined. The organizer features canvas construction that employs a stiffening element for protecting photos, crepe paper, card stock, and other materials. A front pocket on the organizer's exterior enables quick access to frequently used items, like pencils or even house keys. Both sides of the organizer feature pockets that zip open fully to reveal rows of elastic loops affixed to the organizer's side. The loops provide excellent storage markers, crochet hooks, knitting needles, and specialty scissors for crimping and edging. Built into the opposite side of these outer pockets are three mesh pockets in assorted sizes for hole punches, erasers, and measuring tape. In addition to these outer pockets, the organizer's interior houses two larger mesh pockets and more elastic loops for 94 in all. The remaining space easily contains four of the Craftainers' embellishment binders or several balls of yarn. The organizer travels with ease, towed by its telescopic handle on four wheels. For travel, a strap snaps around the handles to secure contents, while a slide-out nametag assures proper identification at baggage claim. The organizer measures 21-1/2 by 16-1/2 by 18-1/4 inches and weighs 13 pounds upon shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PF6SSWAKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rubbermaid","source_asin":"B000G0KPS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-865492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000G0KPS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000G0KPS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
