window.products.push({"id":865568,"name":"Omega Juicers Mega Mouth Black Omega BMJ300 Pulp Ejection Juicer Plastic Bowl (Discontinued","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c1CuhkR5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed with an extra-large feed chute, our Mega Mouth juicers accommodate larger portions and whole fruits. Spend less time cutting or preparing your produce for juicing. Simply flip the power switch and watch the Mega Mouth extract juice from whole fruits and vegetables. The Mega Mouth Juicers use centrifugal force and continuous, pulp ejection for fast and efficient juicing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c1CuhkR5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Omega Juicers","source_asin":"B00CM3XU4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-865568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CM3XU4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CM3XU4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":865569,"name":"38 Pcs Day of The Dead Decorations Set 2 Pcs Artificial Marigold Garland, 30 Pcs Fake Marigold Flowers with Stems, 6 Pcs Monarch Butterfly Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813U2VWPqVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What You Receive: the package includes 2 pieces of faux flower garlands, 30 pieces of artificial marigold flowers with stems and 6 pieces of monarch butterfly decorations, so that the nice combination and enough quantity can meet your Day of the Dead decoration needs Reliable and Quality: this marigold garland for decoration is mainly made of PE material, light in weight and not easy to break or fade, the faux flowers for crafts are mainly made of silk and paired with iron wire stems, reusable and long lasing, and the butterfly decorations are mainly made of PVC, realistic and can bring you a nice use experience Size Information: these fake butterflies are about 12 cm/ 4.7 inches in width, the marigold garland measures approx. 150 cm/ 4.9 feet long, and the orange faux flowers are 5 cm/ 2 inches in diameter with 15 cm/ 6 inches long stems, which can match well with each other and eye catching Classical Holiday Decor: the Day of the Dead decor is designed with marigold flower elements, and paired with monarch butterflies, which are mainly in orange to create a lifelike and realistic feeling and can enhance the holiday atmosphere Wide Applications: these Day of the Dead decorations are suitable for different holiday celebrations, and they can add charm for Diwali decorations, Indian festivals, Thanksgiving, Halloween, Christmas, weddings, bridal showers, home and more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813U2VWPqVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hanaive","source_asin":"B0B63PRKCR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-865569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B63PRKCR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B63PRKCR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":865570,"name":"Kansas City Skyline by Michael Tompsett, 16x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812JwgNdRmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a colorful watercolor skyline of Kansas, city. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Topsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Athrough Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, hi main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates Urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812JwgNdRmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B017NGWI2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-865570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017NGWI2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017NGWI2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":865571,"name":"ABY DECOR Spiritual Celtic Large Metal Wall Cross | Christian Crosses for Wall | Religious Hanging Cross Wall Decor, Best for Home, Office and As Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+hTnTCdSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The ABY DECOR decorative family wall cross is crafted from iron metal which is very durable compared to wooden crosses and Mexican ceramic cross for indoor and outdoor use. The Celtic inspired design of the large metal wall cross is finished in silver nickel and has a very unique and striking design which definitely catches eyes. This wall cross decor is equipped with metal hanger on the back for secured mounting. The stunning cross decor provides a spiritual energy vibe as well as adding a religious artistic and rustic decor in your house and office space. This weights 13 Oz and has the dimensions of 11.75\" by 15.75\" which is also an excellent gift idea to your friends and family for any occasion. This is not only a cross decoration but also symbolizes the faith and dedication of Christ. You can hang the iron decorated crosses in your living room, kitchen, office space, and bedroom or even in your patio area. Some of the amazing features of this product: Large Metal Celtic Wall Cross Large Metal Celtic Wall Cross Comes in Attractive Packaging Comes in Attractive Packaging Sympathy or Bereavement Gift Sympathy or Bereavement Gift High-Quality Pewter Metal High-Quality Pewter Metal Easy to Hang on wall Easy to Hang on wall Suitable for Home, Office & Kitchen Decor Suitable for Home, Office & Kitchen Decor Weight 13 Oz Weight 13 Oz Size 11.75\" by 15.75\" Size 11.75\" by 15.75\" Get 100% money back guarantee on our Large Metal Celtic Wall Cross for home decor. No hassles, no questions asked, just easy refund!!! Now, that you have known our amazingly unique Decorative Family Spiritual Wall Cross, just grab this opportunity, place your Order Now and experience the solace of your life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+hTnTCdSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ABY DECOR","source_asin":"B08HGHGWTB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-865571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HGHGWTB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HGHGWTB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
