window.products.push({"id":865922,"name":"RTMGOB Glass Olive Oil Dispenser Bottle With Silicone Brush, Silicone Dropper Measuring Oil Container Oil Can Oil Dispenser Bottle for Kitchen Cooking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618hroa2UcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique 3 IN 1 Design】Silicone oil applicator brush and oil dispenser are matched together, makes spray oil easy and quantitative. Olive oil dispenser consists of silicone straw tip, transparent oil storage space with measuring scale, T-shaped silicone brush , filter funnel, PE straw and glass bottles. Just squeeze the silicone pipet head you can basting oil easily. 【Food Grade Material】The oil bottle is made of borosilicate glass, which is durable and not easily broken. The silicone dropper and brush are made of food-grade PP. The three-layer short-bristle brush has no peculiar smell, no deformation, no hair loss, and a heat-resistant temperature of up to 250°C/482°F degrees Celsius. 【Easy to Use and Clean】Our oil dispenser bottles, just fill oil from the wide mouth of the glass oil bottle, squeeze the silicone head and oil will come up from the straw to the transparent space, then you can squeeze the silicone head slightly to basting oil on the pan or grilling food. Each part of the cooking oil dispenser can be disassembled and cleaned individuallyn and easy to install also. 【Multi-Purpose】This oil dispenser with brush can easily baste meat or fish when fried with pan, or use for grillings long time without taking oil frequently. Best oil basting brush with dispenser bottle for baking or cooking without dealing with the messy drips. Works great on a variety of foods, including meats, pastries, veges, Marinade with oil, honey, sauces and so on! Coat quickly on your food and less soaking in the brush. 【What You Get】1 x Olive Oil Dispenser Bottle, 1 x Cleaning brush. If there is any quality problem with the product, please don’t hesitate to contact us, we will be happy to help you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618hroa2UcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RTMGOB","source_asin":"B09TT1KF89","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-865922","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TT1KF89","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TT1KF89","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
