window.products.push({"id":865960,"name":"Ithmahco Valentines Day Gift For Him Father, Son, Kids | Funny Birthday Gifts for Dad of 16 Wooden Hearts Printed with Words about Father | Unique Bir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WMgOYkdxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💌 Fathers Day is coming? Or dad's birthday? Maybe you'd like to surprise your father with a sort of love letter? Not like all these frames, pillows, blankets, mugs, and posters. But A funny and novelty gift to make it being unique. 💖The content on the heart-shaped wood is varied, including interesting words and words of gratitude to the father. When your father is reading these words, he will laugh and be moved. And these heart-shaped woods will become a memorable gift for your father. 😄Some interesting words are as follows: ♥Here’s wishing you a year of love, luck, and money to pay your child support. ♥Best Farter Ever. Oops! I meant Father.  ♥In the world of fathers, my dad rules supreme. ♥Thanks for not leaving me in a basket somewhere. ♥If I had a different dad, I would punch him in the face and go find you. ❤️Some gratitude and praise words are as follows: ♥You truly are a one in a million father. ♥Thank you for being such a special person in my life. ♥Dad, I want to thank you for making such a positive impact on my life. ♥The greatest hero in my world is you, my sweet daddy. ♥You are worth showing to the world, Dad. 💖Wooden hearts, wooden box, and card in a delicate packaging. The box looks gorgeous, and you don't need to look for additional gift packaging. 💟Kit: Wood Hearts Printed with Messages about Father - 16pc. Natural or handmade wood box - 1pc. Greeting card - 1pc. Craft paper box- 1pc. please note: wood grain, texture and color may vary slightly to our images as no two trees are alike. Have a nice day!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WMgOYkdxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ithmahco","source_asin":"B09538PP49","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-865960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09538PP49","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09538PP49","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
